{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"workshop_t1","model_identifier":"workshop_t1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# workshop_t1\n\nWork Hut (workshop tier 1): a log hut with a chopping block and a stone-crushing quern (hand mill) whose upper stone turns.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: an open-fronted craftsman's workshop of honey-coloured planks and near-black posts under a steep shingle roof, with a striped ochre canvas awning over the open bay. Inside and around it: a workbench with a tool board, a sawhorse with a half-cut plank, a pole lathe, a tall lumber rack, a hide on a drying frame, a herb rack, rope coils, a log pile, a stump with an axe and a half-built cart. The working clip saws and turns the lathe.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: an open-fronted craftsman's workshop of honey-coloured planks and near-black posts under a steep shingle roof, with a striped ochre canvas awning over the open bay. Inside and around it: a workbench with a tool board, a sawhorse with a half-cut plank, a pole lathe, a tall lumber rack, a hide on a drying frame, a herb rack, rope coils, a log pile, a stump with an axe and a half-built cart. The working clip saws and turns the lathe.\n\n- Footprint: 7 x 6 columns (112 x 96 units, 3.15 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -55..56, y -1..111, z -49..46 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 488, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hut: 72 x 100 x 60 centred at x -4, z 14\n\n## Clips\n\n- `working` (2.0 s, loop): the saw slides back and forth on the sawhorse, the lathe stock spins and the treadle rocks.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -41)\n- `slot_work` at (-20, 0, -42)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (12, 0, -42)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-44.8, 55, 17)\n- `fx_window_2` at (44.8, 55, 17)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-10, 55, 40.6)\n- `fx_window_4` at (10, 55, 40.6)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-44.3, 84, 18)\n- `fx_window_6` at (44.3, 84, 18)"},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"cobble_plinth_back","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-45,-0.15,32],"to":[45,6,41],"autouv":0,"color":9,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[228,202,318,208],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[250,209,259,215],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[318,202,408,208],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[259,209,268,215],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[30,168,120,177],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[120,168,210,177],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7c8b9518-de22-29e3-cb71-5d219efbbe30"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_left","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-45.15,-0.3,-5],"to":[-36,6.12,33],"autouv":0,"color":1,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[268,209,277,215],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[748,202,786,208],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[277,209,286,215],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[786,202,824,208],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[468,76,477,114],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[477,76,486,114],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e1038adf-32bf-4873-8266-fe082feec95b"},{"name":"cobble_plinth_right","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[36,-0.3,-5],"to":[45.15,6.12,33],"autouv":0,"color":9,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[286,209,295,215],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[824,202,862,208],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[295,209,304,215],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[862,202,900,208],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[486,7