interpolation":false},"0f31e023-da91-43b6-c6fc-2f1fab01511b":{"name":"fx_window_2","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"491f3c19-c282-6976-f533-afdf43c3eeef":{"name":"fx_window_3","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"e8c4063c-ac6b-2612-df61-fe490813e61e":{"name":"fx_window_4","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"7176671e-bdac-47ed-d62c-37d61f893682":{"name":"fx_window_5","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false},"96274b6c-e282-7282-b8a4-617d17dfaefe":{"name":"fx_window_6","type":"bone","rotation_global":false,"quaternion_interpolation":false}}}],"description":"# workshop_t1\n\nWork Hut (workshop tier 1): a log hut with a chopping block and a stone-crushing quern (hand mill) whose upper stone turns.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: an open-fronted craftsman's workshop of honey-coloured planks and near-black posts under a steep shingle roof, with a striped ochre canvas awning over the open bay. Inside and around it: a workbench with a tool board, a sawhorse with a half-cut plank, a pole lathe, a tall lumber rack, a hide on a drying frame, a herb rack, rope coils, a log pile, a stump with an axe and a half-built cart. The working clip saws and turns the lathe.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: an open-fronted craftsman's workshop of honey-coloured planks and near-black posts under a steep shingle roof, with a striped ochre canvas awning over the open bay. Inside and around it: a workbench with a tool board, a sawhorse with a half-cut plank, a pole lathe, a tall lumber rack, a hide on a drying frame, a herb rack, rope coils, a log pile, a stump with an axe and a half-built cart. The working clip saws and turns the lathe.\n\n- Footprint: 7 x 6 columns (112 x 96 units, 3.15 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -55..56, y -1..111, z -49..46 units.\n- Texture: 1024 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 488, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- hut: 72 x 100 x 60 centred at x -4, z 14\n\n## Clips\n\n- `working` (2.0 s, loop): the saw slides back and forth on the sawhorse, the lathe stock spins and the treadle rocks.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -41)\n- `slot_work` at (-20, 0, -42)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (12, 0, -42)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-44.8, 55, 17)\n- `fx_window_2` at (44.8, 55, 17)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-10, 55, 40.6)\n- `fx_window_4` at (10, 55, 40.6)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-44.3, 84, 18)\n- `fx_window_6` at (44.3, 84, 18)"}